{"workspace_id":"0745b727-7577-463c-a2bc-3f85582e7a05","revision":3,"source":"synthetic:cedar/03-cost-scope-note.md","title":"03-cost-scope-note.md","id":"cedar-3","text":"# Cedar C-21 operating-cost evidence boundary\nDocument status: final companion note to controlled trial C-21.\nSynthetic local evidence only.\nC-21 measured electricity consumption, not monthly operating cost. Site electricity tariffs, maintenance charges, and equipment lease prices were not collected. No operating-cost comparison between Dune and Reed can be computed from the C-21 package.\nThe signed C-21 measurement sheet and approved C-21 acceptance rule are the sources for trial acceptance. This note supplies no replacement temperature or energy readings.\n","version":3}